{number: 11}
{title: All Creatures of Our God and King}
{key: D}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[D] All creatures of our [Bm] God and King
[G] Lift up your voice and [A] with us sing:
[D] Alleluia! [G] Alle-[D] luia!
Thou [D] burning sun with [Bm] golden beam,
Thou [G] silver moon with [A] softer gleam!
O [D] praise Him, O [G] praise Him,
Alle-[D] luia! Alle-[A] luia! Alle-[D] luia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
Thou [D] rushing wind that [Bm] art so strong,
Ye [G] clouds that sail in [A] heav'n along,
O [D] praise Him! Alle-[G] lu-[D] ia!
Thou [D] rising morn in [Bm] praise rejoice,
Ye [G] lights of evening, [A] find a voice!
O [D] praise Him, O [G] praise Him,
Alle-[D] luia! Alle-[A] luia! Alle-[D] luia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
Dear [D] mother earth, who [Bm] day by day
Un-[G] foldest blessing [A] on our way,
O [D] praise Him! Alle-[G] lu-[D] ia!
The [D] flow'rs and fruits that [Bm] in thee grow,
Let [G] them His glory [A] also show!
O [D] praise Him, O [G] praise Him,
Alle-[D] luia! Alle-[A] luia! Alle-[D] luia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
Let [D] all things their Cre-[Bm] ator bless,
And [G] worship Him in [A] humbleness,
O [D] praise Him! Alle-[G] lu-[D] ia!
Praise, [D] praise the Father, [Bm] praise the Son
And [G] praise the Spirit, [A] three in one!
O [D] praise Him, O [G] praise Him,
Alle-[D] luia! Alle-[A] luia! Alle-[D] luia!
{end_of_verse}
